grafana  mirror.gcr.io/grafana/grafana:13.3.0  Up 15 seconds  127.0.0.1:3390->3000/tcp
prometheus  quay.io/prometheus/prometheus:v3.16.0  Up 15 seconds  127.0.0.1:9390->9090/tcp

$ curl -s http://localhost:8300/healthz
{"healthy":true,"release":"3.0.0"}

$ curl -s http://localhost:8300/metrics | grep -E '^textstats_(http_requests_total|words_processed_total)'
